================================================================================
HOW TO DOWNLOAD FULL RAW LOGS & APK DIRECTLY FROM GITHUB:
================================================================================
1. Open your repository on GitHub:
   https://github.com/<your-username>/<your-repository>

2. Navigate to the "Actions" tab in the top navigation bar.

3. Click on the most recent workflow run in the list (e.g. "Build APK" or "build.yml").

4. In the top-right corner of the run details page:
   - Click the gear/three dots icon "..." -> "Download log archive (.zip)" to get the complete raw log package.

5. Under the "Artifacts" section at the bottom of the summary page:
   - Click on "release-apk" or "app-release" to download the compiled Android APK package.
